{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  allows you to limit the data to a determined activity pack among those that the user has used at any time. The }{\uldb\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 Reports by activities and packs}{\v\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 
INFPAC}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  window also allows you to get detailed information on the results of a user regarding a particular pack.
\par }\pard\plain \s15\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\fs20\lang1027\langfe3082\cgrid\langnp1027\langfenp3082 {\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 
\par }\pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\fs20\lang1027\langfe3082\cgrid\langnp1027\langfenp3082 {\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 The }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 From... To...}{
\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  button leads you to a window where you can indicate the period of time contemplated in the report.
\par 
\par The }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 Sessions}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  list shows all the times that the user has used the selected pack (or any pack, if none has been marked). Clicking on the elem
ents of this list will show a detailed table of all the activities that the user has done in that session: the name of the pack and activity, time taken, attempts, correct answers, completion and global precision. Underneath this table there is another wi
th the resume of the session: number of activities done, activities completed, total time and average global precision.
\par 
\par The }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 Session summary }{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 that appears below the pack list is calculated from the data of all the sessions on the list.
\par 
\par The graph represents the evolution of two variables over a time: the global precision (the average precision of the user in each session) and the percentage of activities solved in respect of the total number of activities done.
\par 
\par The }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 Print}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  button allows you to carry out two di
fferent functions: to overturn the printer that appears in the image on the screen (including the graphic) or a list of the data in text format. If you opt for the list, there is two further options available: print only the data referring to the selected
 session or print the complete relation of activities of all the sessions.
\par 
\par \{bmc linia.bmp\}
\par 
\par }{\uldb\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 \{bmc back.bmp\}}{\v\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 INDEX}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057    Back to contents
\par 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\keepn\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 \page }{\cs16\lang2057\langfe3082\super\langnp2057 #{\footnote \pard\plain 
