\par The file containing the base usually increases its size even though data is cleaned or users or groups are eliminated.
\par 
\par Every so often you should carry out a maintenance operation, which involves cleaning data that is no longer valid from the files. The database will work faster and more agile if you compact it regularly.
\par 
\par It's advisable to make a security copy of the CLICDB.MDB file before undertaking this operation, as a power cut or a system failure could render the base unusable.
\par 
\par The operation of compacting the database should never be undertaken while there are other users working with Clic on the network.
\par 
\par Compacting may take some minutes if the database has grown a lot.
\par 
\par \{bmc linia.bmp\}
\par 
